{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53834","headline":"再游应天寺圣母阁 · 李绅","name":"再游应天寺圣母阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越地灵踪多少处，伽蓝难尚此楼台。\n有时风掣浪声到，半夜月排山势来。\n极目烟岚迷远近，百般花木离尘埃。\n可怜光景吟不尽，知我登临更几回。\n（宋孔延之编《会稽掇英总集》卷八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53834.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53834","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}